I come back to my quiet home.
It is very humid outside.
It feels good inside the house.
I put my shopping bag on the table.
I take the new raincoat and cotton shirt out of the bag.
I like this new shirt a lot.
I quickly try on this shirt.
I put it on, but I have trouble.
This shirt is very tight at the shoulders.
I look in the mirror.
It is too small for me.
I need a shirt bigger than this.
I did not try it on in the shop.
This is my mistake.
I have to exchange this shirt.
But today I do not want to go in the bus again.
I am very tired.
I will go to exchange this shirt tomorrow morning.
